OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost parts starting cloudy and
OL,6,Fhumid, with outbreaks of rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle but turning drier and brighter
OL,8,Ffrom the north through the day. Winds
OL,9,Fmainly light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAreas of cloud and some
OL,12,Fclearer periods. Most parts dry but
OL,13,Fthicker cloud developing across the
OL,14,FPeak District later with some patchy
OL,15,Flight rain, drizzle and hill fog. Mild.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FAreas of cloud giving a few
OL,18,Fshowers in places through the morning
OL,19,Fbut generally drier and brighter into
OL,20,Fthe afternoon. Feeling warm with
OL,21,Fbreezier winds later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
